  "readme": "# Fast Parser\n\nFast Parser is a minimal, lightweight, zero-dependency parser designed for parsing structured configuration strings and domain specific syntax with high throughput.\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\npnpm add fast-parser\n```\n\n## Usage\n\n```typescript\nimport { parse } from 'fast-parser';\nconst ast = parse('key = value');\n```\n\n## Visuals\n\n![Benchmark Chart](https://fast-parser.dev/benchmarks.png)\n\n## License\n\nReleased under the MIT License.\n",
